Date: Tue, 28 Jul 2026 10:02:37 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 4/6] Fix WSG flag-carrier freeze and rework proactive
 flag-fetching

- Flag carriers no longer freeze forever in the middle of the map when the enemy also holds our own flag. They previously got sent to a random "hiding spot" in that case, and a separate safety guard then permanently refused to ever pick a new objective once the bot arrived there. They now always head straight to base instead - worst case they wait there for our flag to come home.
- Bots no longer walk to the enemy flag spawn on their own initiative to grab it by default (they patrol instead) - they still defend their own carrier and chase down whoever's holding our flag.
- Exception: a bot goes back to actively fetching the enemy flag if its own team currently has zero real players (checked per-team, not "anyone in the match" - a solo human always counts as present on their own team). This means a solo human playing against an all-bot team still faces a team that tries to cap, while matches with real players on both sides are unaffected.
